"""A sparse surface-pattern approximation, not a centrality classifier.

Positive pulses mark center/centre spellings, theatre/concert words, and
selected stem completions across token boundaries.  Signed English phrase
rules distinguish 'at the age', 'in the sense', 'to the nearest', etc.
Two separate formatting rules recognize a document-initial 'Title:' and
runs of at least three all-middle-dot tokens.  Everything else is near
zero.  State is a short unfinished word, two preceding tokens, the last
pulse and a dot-run count; it resets at each document boundary.
