responses. Approximate the start by script, spacing, case and function-word
class. Keep that response through an initially repeated token run. Afterwards,
predict nearly zero for ordinary text and small negative values for line breaks,
JSON separators and code markup, using the preceding token for local context.
These broad classes omit substantial word-specific variation at document starts.
